Then the same couple,
married with children.

956
01:24:57.842 --> 01:24:59.510
In short, marriage.

957
01:24:59.677 --> 01:25:02.137
The perfect, ideal, successful marriage.

958
01:25:02.305 --> 01:25:04.723
